From 1ab42a3a62f629b08cb874bf19f49a990e8c764b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 18:51:28 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: handle M4 firmware counter rollover

Wrap firmware-width stamps and metadata without imposing a device lifetime submission limit. Initialize completion destinations to the target predecessor so zero and high stamps cannot complete prematurely. Keep compute context identity separate from the wrapping low counter word.

Validated with host encoder and timeline regression tests and accelerated hardware qualification across signed, stamp, and metadata boundaries.

Assisted-By: OpenAI Codex (GPT-6 Astra)
Signed-off-by: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
